---
import ExternalNote from "../../components/ExternalNote.astro";
---

<section id="external-note" class="dev-section">
  <h2>外部リンクの注記</h2>
  <p>見えない文は読み上げ用。↗ は <code>arrow</code> のときだけ出る。</p>
  <div class="dev-row">
    <a href="https://example.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      >矢印なし<ExternalNote lang="ja" /></a
    >
    <a href="https://example.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      >矢印あり<ExternalNote lang="ja" arrow /></a
    >
    <a href="https://example.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      >With arrow<ExternalNote lang="en" arrow /></a
    >
  </div>
</section>
